  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given: <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mfenced><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mi>tan</mi><mi>x</mi><msqrt><msup><mi>tan</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></msqrt></mrow><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>7</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>3</mn></msup></mfrac></math></p><p>We know that, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced><mn>0</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>→</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></munder><mfrac><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>h</mi></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>0</mn></mfenced></mrow><mi>h</mi></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced><mn>0</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>→</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></munder><mfrac><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mfenced><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>h</mi></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>h</mi></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mi>tan</mi><mi>h</mi><msqrt><msup><mi>tan</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>h</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mi>h</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></msqrt></mrow><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>7</mn><msup><mi>h</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>h</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>3</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mfenced><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>0</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>0</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mi>tan</mi><mn>0</mn><msqrt><msup><mi>tan</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></msqrt></mrow><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>3</mn></msup></mfrac></mrow><mi>h</mi></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced><mn>0</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>→</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></munder><mfrac><mrow><mfenced><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>h</mi></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>h</mi></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mi>tan</mi><mi>h</mi><msqrt><msup><mi>tan</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>h</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mi>h</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></msqrt></mrow><mrow><mi>h</mi><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>7</mn><msup><mi>h</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>h</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced><mn>0</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>→</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></munder><mfrac><mrow><mfenced><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>h</mi></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>h</mi></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><msqrt><msup><mi>tan</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>h</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mi>h</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></msqrt></mrow><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>7</mn><msup><mi>h</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>h</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>3</mn></msup></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced><mn>0</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mfenced><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>0</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>0</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><msqrt><msup><mi>tan</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></msqrt></mrow